# Witness: a route table missing one of the eight review areas

The eight review areas are a fixed enumeration in the rule, not whatever the document
under test happens to declare. Deriving the expectation from the document let a whole
risk area be deleted from every table that names it and the suite stay green.

## 4. Review Route

